Last month, Apple <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/25/apple-announces-2026-mac-mini/">announced</a> a new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/mac-mini/">Mac mini</a> built around the all-new M6 chip and the M5 Pro, replacing the M4 and M4 Pro models that had been on sale since October 2024. Pre-orders are open now, with the machines arriving to customers and in stores on September 22.<br/>
<br/>
